      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 555,
      "ruku": 488,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5197,
      "text": "O you who believe, do not let your wealth and your children distract you from Allah’s remembrance. For whoever does that, it is they who are the losers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 63,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُنَافِقُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Munaafiqoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Hypocrites",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 555,
      "ruku": 489,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5198,
      "text": "And spend from what We have provided for you before death comes to one of you, then he would say, “My Lord, If only You had delayed me for a short while, so that I would give in charity and be one of the righteous.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 63,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُنَافِقُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Munaafiqoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Hypocrites",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 555,
      "ruku": 489,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5199,
      "text": "But Allah will never delay a soul when its appointed time comes, and Allah is All-Aware of what you do.",
